OL,3,APeople deserve to 'feel safe' after
OL,4,Acrash and fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown told Radio 4's Today programme he
OL,7,Fwould be meeting with councillors,
OL,8,Fpolice and social housing providers on
OL,9,FFriday.
OL,11,FMeanwhile Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,12,Fsaid "all of the support will be
OL,13,Fprovided to get to the heart of what
OL,14,Fhas happened".
